      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/puerto-rico/exchange-note-1-peso-1895/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/puerto-rico/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Puerto Rico catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Exchange Note &middot; Overseas Ministry &middot; 1895</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">One Peso</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Puerto Rico &middot; Portrait of Juan Ponce de León</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"puerto-rico-billete-canje-1895\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/puerto-rico-billete-de-canje-1-peso-1895-640.webp 640w, /uploads/puerto-rico-billete-de-canje-1-peso-1895.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/puerto-rico-billete-de-canje-1-peso-1895.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote of Canje de One Peso del Ministerio de Ultramar, Puerto Rico, obverse above and reverse below, 1895\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"588\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Puerto Rico (Spanish Overseas Province)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ministry of Overseas, Government of Spain</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">One Peso, equivalent to a 25-gram silver peso (.900 fineness)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Type of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Exchange Note &mdash;temporary instrument created to collect foreign silver in circulation, redeemable later for the new provincial currency minted in Spain</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Framework</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Created by Article 1&deg; of the Royal Decree of August 17, 1895</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatures</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The Director of the Treasury, the Authorizing Officer and the Comptroller</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick #7a</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"puerto-rico-billete-canje-1895\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/puerto-rico-billete-de-canje-1-peso-1895.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/puerto-rico-billete-de-canje-1-peso-1895.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Canje de One Peso, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The monetary chaos of the end of the century:</strong>During the 19th century, Puerto Rico lacked its own currency and depended on a chaotic mix of foreign currencies &mdash;mainly dollars and Mexican pesos&mdash; that the Spanish authorities attempted to control through perforations, countermarks, and successive decrees of 1870, 1884, and 1894. By 1895, the government decided to completely replace this foreign currency with a currency exclusive provincial for the island.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">An ephemeral banknote:</strong>The Royal Decree of August 17, 1895 created this Exchange Note as a temporary instrument: foreign silver in circulation was collected in exchange for these notes, which were sent to Spain to mint the new provincial currency of Puerto Rico. Once minted, the note was redeemed for its equivalent in provincial silver &mdash; after discounting the transportation and minting costs &mdash;, in what is known as the &ldquo;second exchange&rdquo;. Its active circulation barely lasted a few months.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A surplus turned into a souvenir:</strong>an estimated five million of these notes were printed, far exceeding the amount of silver actually collected. The surplus was acquired by Leopoldo Cerecedo Millán's commercial firm, which distributed them with commemorative overprints in 1920 &mdash;the reason unoverprinted examples such as this one are more coveted by collectors.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Central portrait:</strong>Juan Ponce de León, Spanish conquistador and first governor of Puerto Rico, depicted in profile with a beard and period attire within an engraved oval.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Dry seal:</strong>on the right of the obverse, an embossed stamp (visible without ink) with the legend &ldquo;Canje de Puerto Rico&rdquo; and the image of a sailboat with an anchor, in direct reference to the Ministry of Overseas Affairs.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Text of the obligation:</strong>&ldquo; REDEMPTION NOTE, created by the Art&ordm; 1&ordm; of the R&ordf; D&ordf; of August 17, 1895. WORTH ONE PESO&rdquo;, with the printed signatures of the three responsible Treasury officials.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>printing in green ink with the royal shield of Spain &mdash;castle and lion, stamped with crown&mdash;, flanked by ornamental foliage and the legend &ldquo;EXCHANGE NOTE&rdquo; on the lower cartouche.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Issued just three years before the end of Spanish rule on the island after the Spanish-American War of 1898, this note documents one of the Crown's last attempts to modernize and control the economy of its overseas territories. Together with the provincial silver peso that it replaced, it marks the closing of a turbulent monetary chapter that dated back to decades of circulation of mutilated and countermarked foreign currencies on the island.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Pick, Albert.<em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money — Specialized Issues.</em></li>\n              <li>General Archive of Puerto Rico</li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <aside aria-labelledby=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin:48px auto 0; padding-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n      <h2 id=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px; font-style:normal;\">Keep exploring</h2>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:14px;\">\n        <a href=\"/blog/origenes-banca-comercial-puerto-rico/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Origins of commercial banking in Puerto Rico</a>\n        <a href=\"/en/collection/puerto-rico/junta-central-cuba-1869/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Republican Central Board of Cuba and Puerto Rico</a>\n        <a href=\"/en/collection/puerto-rico/republic-of-cuba-1-peso-1869/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Republic of Cuba — 1 peso, 1869</a>\n        <a href=\"/glosario/#banco-emisor\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Glossary: issuing bank</a>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
